                                            <rect key="frame" x="24" y="160" width="275" height="267"/>
                                            <autoresizingMask key="autoresizingMask" flexibleMaxX="YES" flexibleMaxY="YES"/>
                                            <color key="backgroundColor" white="0.0" alpha="0.0" colorSpace="calibratedWhite"/>
                                            <string key="text">Humankind has accumulated CO₂ and other greenhouse gases in the atmos-
phere which has already increased average global temperature by one degree Celsius since 1750.

In order to stop global warming, humankind needs to stop emitting CO₂ and reduce other greenhouse gas emissions. The earlier we stop, the less harmful the effects of global warming will be.</string>
                                            <color key="textColor" white="1" alpha="1" colorSpace="calibratedWhite"/>
